        <mxCell id="review" value="&lt;b&gt;复习 / 扩展入口&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;复写最小移动 demo：相机 → IMC 注册 → BindAction → Move / Look → Jump → Dash / Landed。扩展冲刺冷却或次数，先调整 bCanDash 的状态策略。" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbea;strokeColor=#cfb85c;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=16;fontColor=#253349;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=17;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
